{"text": "On Saturday morning I reminded my uncle that I wished to go to the bazaar in the evening, and he answered curtly, Yes, boy, I know. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At seven oclock the servant came to tell me that my uncle had not yet come home, and I sat staring at the clock for some time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When its ticking began to irritate me, I left the room and walked up and down the cold, empty, gloomy rooms upstairs, singing to myself. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At nine oclock I heard my uncles latchkey in the hall door, and I could tell from the way he talked to himself that he had been drinking. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When I asked him a second time for the money to go to the bazaar, he said that he had forgotten all about it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Finally he gave me a florin, and I held it tightly in my hand as I walked quickly down to the station. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I took my seat in a third class carriage of a deserted train, which, after an intolerable delay, crept slowly out of the station. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was ten minutes to ten when I finally reached the bazaar, and I saw the large building with its magical name shining above the door.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "n", " ", "S", "a", "t", "u", "r", "d", "a", "y", " ", "m", "o", "r", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "I", " ", "r", "e", "m", "i", "n", "d", "e", "d", " ", "m", "y", " ", "u", "n", "c", "l", "e", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "I", " ", "w", "i", "s", "h", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "g", "o", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "a", "z", "a", "a", "r", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "e", "v", "e", "n", "i", "n", "g", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "h", "e", " ", "a", "n", "s", "w", "e", "r", "e", "d", " ", "c", "u", "r", "t", "l", "y", ",", " ", "Y", "e", "s", ",", " ", "b", "o", "y", ",", " ", "I", " ", "k", "n", "o", "w", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "